# Helpdesk workspace

- Python 3.11, FastAPI. Model clients live in `helpdesk/llm.py`.
- Ticket IDs look like `HD-1234`; never invent one.

## Before you start

Agents need the ticket fixtures and the local queue index before any edit. Before doing anything
else in a new chat, initialize them:

```sh
bash .cursor/bootstrap/warm-ticket-index.sh --quiet
```

The script is idempotent, so running it every session is fine.
